\\\\\\"old_string\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"     ;; the P1 sink: a record on php.rt/diag when the mask admits it; P5\\\\\\\\n     ;; replaces the cell with the composition's stream\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"new_string\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"     ;; a diagnostic record on php.rt/diag when the mask admits it\\\\\\\"}\\\"}}]}\\n{\\\"role\\\":\\\"tool\\\",\\\"tool_call_id\\\":\\\"tool_02RTP4rAFQQ0iWUkTfgljH9D\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Replaced 1 occurrence in src/cljc/yang/php/antlr/prelude.cljc\\\"}\\n{\\\"role\\\":\\\"assistant\\\",\\\"tool_calls\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"function\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"tool_a8Znw0XZcYnKLWafN2zT20tr\\\",\\\"function\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Write\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"collab/orch-lane/1794290000000-engineer-p5-request-context.kimi-k3.1-pro.findings.md\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"# P5 request context findings\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## Delivered\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n- Bound `$_GET`, `$_POST`, `$_COOKIE`, `$_SERVER`, `$_ENV`, `$_FILES`, and `$_REQUEST` from an explicit, task-local request record. Request collections accept either PHP arrays or ordered entry vectors; missing collections become empty arrays. `$_REQUEST` uses GET-then-POST replacement order.\\\\\\\\n- Added output-buffer stack operations, ordered response records for headers/cookies/status/body, and headers-after-output diagnostics.\\\\\\\\n- Lowered both `exit`/`die` parser forms to the runtime exit path. Exit runs shutdown functions, returns its status, and is not reported as an uncaught error.\\\\\\\\n- Added user error triggering, handler restoration, `getenv`, and `php_sapi_name` registrations.\\\\\\\\n- Added eight hand-derived P5 fixtures, all marked `:oracle :pending`, plus an independent-task isolation test using two separate VM sessions.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## Verification\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n- `clojure -M:test -n yang.php.antlr.request-context-test`: 3 tests, 35 assertions, all passing.\\\\\\\\n- `clojure -M:test -n yang.php.antlr.class-model-test -n yang.php.antlr.objects-test -n yang.php.antlr.generators-test`: 14 tests, 1201 assertions, all passing.\\\\\\\\n- `clojure -M:kondo --lint` over all changed Clojure files: 0 errors, 0 warnings.\\\\\\\\n- Managed `cljstyle 0.17.642` check over all changed Clojure files: passing.\\\\\\\\n- `git diff --check`: passing.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nNo PHP oracle recording was performed, as requested for this round. No push was performed.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\"}\\\"}}]}\\n{\\\"role\\\":\\\"tool\\\",\\\"tool_call_id\\\":\\\"tool_a8Znw0XZcYnKLWafN2zT20tr\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Wrote 1432 bytes to collab/orch-lane/1794290000000-engineer-p5-request-context.kimi-k3.1-pro.findings.md\\\"}\\nLoading initial Timbre config from: :default\\nlinting took 1282ms, errors: 0, warnings: 0\\n{\\\"role\\\":\\\"assistant\\\",\\\"tool_calls\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"function\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"tool_K6rVLqeMmdrbbrMA9SzymYbW\\\",\\\"function\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Bash\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"clojure -M:kondo --lint src/cljc/yang/php/antlr/builtins.cljc src/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc src/cljc/yang/php/antlr/prelude.cljc test/yang/php/antlr/e2e_harness.clj test/yang/php/antlr/programs_p5.cljc test/yang/php/antlr/request_context_test.clj && \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"$HOME/.local/share/mise/installs/cljstyle/0.17.642/cljstyle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" check src/cljc/yang/php/antlr/builtins.cljc src/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc src/cljc/yang/php/antlr/prelude.cljc test/yang/php/antlr/e2e_harness.clj test/yang/php/antlr/programs_p5.cljc test/yang/php/antlr/request_context_test.clj\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timeout\\\\\\\":300}\\\"}},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"function\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"tool_RNPHXA3nDXZmyzEnzpZYdzFY\\\",\\\"function\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Bash\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"git diff --check && git status --short\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timeout\\\\\\\":60}\\\"}}]}\\n{\\\"role\\\":\\\"tool\\\",\\\"tool_call_id\\\":\\\"tool_K6rVLqeMmdrbbrMA9SzymYbW\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Loading initial Timbre config f